Update_ConfirmMe	Do you want to update me to build {0}?	是否将本程序更新到构建 {0}？
Update_UpdatingMe	Updating me...	正在更新本程序...
Update_MeFailedLaunchUpdater	Update me failed: failed to launch updater.	更新本程序失败：无法启动更新程序。
Update_MeCheckFailed	Check update of me failed: {0}	检查本程序更新失败：{0}
Update_NoMeUpdate	No update of me found.	未发现本程序的更新。
Update_UnknownBuild	unknown	未知
Update_BuildLabel	Build {0}	构建 {0}
Update_DevBuild	Development build	开发版构建
Update_OpenHomePageFailed	Failed to open home page: {0}	打开主页失败：{0}
Storage_AskMoveFiles	Move the existing files to the new location?\nYes: move the Config and Settings folders there.\nNo: keep the files where they are and use the new location as is.	是否将现有文件移动到新位置？\n是：把 Config 和 Settings 目录整体移动过去。\n否：不移动任何文件，直接使用新位置。
Storage_LeavePortableMustMove	Leaving portable mode requires moving the files, otherwise portable mode will be detected again on next startup. Move and continue?	离开便携模式必须移动文件，否则下次启动会再次检测为便携模式。是否移动并继续？
